{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:0.4"], "en": "5. The Nakula Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:1.1", "PA_ja_165:1.2"], "en": "“Having made an alliance with an enemy—whether born from an egg or born from a womb;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:1.3"], "en": "“Having exposed your fangs you lie there;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:1.4"], "en": "from where has fear come upon you?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:2.1"], "en": "“I am indeed suspicious of my enemy.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:2.2"], "en": "One should not trust even a friend;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:2.3"], "en": "for fear may arise from the fearless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:2.4"], "en": "even to the point of uprooting one’s very foundations.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_165:3.1"], "en": "The Nakula Jātaka, the fifth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
